Fix $t\in[0,1]$ and consider the quadratic energy
\begin{equation}
\label{eq:energy-ab}
\mathcal J_t(a,b)
:= \mathbb{E}_{\pi_t}\!\big[\,|a(X)+b(Y)|^2\,\big]
