\label{ass:velocity_regularity}
The marginal velocity fields $u_t, v_t$ are sufficiently smooth in space and time. Specifically, there exist uniform constants $C_\mathrm{uv}, L_\mathrm{uv} < \infty$ such that:
\begin{equation}
